Map {
  "1.0.0.0" => "The first thing we should do is give them
a demonstration of our might!",
  "1.0.1.0" => "Very well. Show off our strength by scattering
the monsters plaguing the nearby villages.",
  "1.0.2.0" => "Allow me to gain control of the building to
the north. Its aesthetic...speaks to me.",
  "1.0.3.0" => "Hss... Scheming!",
  "1.0.4.0" => "Keh... Fools! Destroy!",
  "1.0.5.0" => "Claiming the keeps should drive out the
monsters from the village as well.",
  "1.0.6.0" => "Hiding in your little keeps cannot protect
you from our awesome might!",
  "1.0.7.0" => "It appears that we have but one keep left
to claim. Let's take it immediately!",
  "1.0.8.0" => "Kah! Frustrated! Take back keep!",
  "1.0.9.0" => "Hsss... Incompetence!",
  "1.0.10.0" => "Kya! Defend keep!",
  "1.0.11.0" => "If we're to take the village, we must crush
every last wretched creature in that keep.",
  "1.0.12.0" => "HA! Lizalfos too strong! Numbers too
great! Cannot match usssss!",
  "1.0.13.0" => "It appears that the vermin have come out...
A good opportunity to take the settlement.",
  "1.0.14.0" => "Yes, this should be their final curtain call.
We can finish them by taking this last keep.",
  "1.0.15.0" => "REH! Take back keep!",
  "1.0.16.0" => "Hssss... Fools!",
  "1.0.17.0" => "Such weaklings...",
  "1.0.18.0" => "Do you realize the doors are still closed? How
am I to do anything when they're closed?",
  "1.0.19.0" => "Without that door opening... I'm stumped.
Pardon me while I investigate further.",
  "1.0.20.0" => "Kya! Noise from outside!",
  "1.0.21.0" => "Hssss... Shadows approaching...",
  "1.0.22.0" => "Kya! Protect territory!",
  "1.0.23.0" => "Have the worms come out to play?
Heh, lovely...",
  "1.0.24.0" => "Monsters? In prison? Perhaps they could
be persuaded to serve Lord Ganondorf...",
  "1.0.25.0" => "Leave King Dodongo for me...",
  "1.0.26.0" => "King Dodongo is not our top priority. We
have to dispatch the group before us first.",
  "1.0.27.0" => "I must not disgrace my master's name!",
  "1.0.28.0" => "Strength befitting the Demon King!
It's wonderful!",
  "1.0.29.0" => "I have...failed? No! I didn't want to fail!",
  "1.0.30.0" => "And so the world is spared such majesty...",
  "1.0.31.0" => "Hmm. Small progress...",
  "1.0.32.0" => "Their commander has appeared? Good. If I
eliminate him, his minions will kneel before me.",
  "1.0.33.0" => "Seeing those two together is quite a sight.
I could watch this sort of violence all day!",
  "1.0.34.0" => "The master of the desert is not my primary
enemy...",
  "1.0.35.0" => "At least one of the vermin has been disposed
of. Let's take care of the remaining enemies.",
  "1.0.36.0" => "How do they expect to defeat us? It's almost
an unfair fight...by which I mean it truly is.",
  "1.0.37.0" => "Now THIS is the power of a god!",
  "1.0.38.0" => "Ganondorf reminds me of my lord,
Demise... May his reign never cease!",
  "1.0.39.0" => "This resistance was pitiful, but oh well.
Not every battle can be one worth retelling.",
  "1.0.40.0" => "Free us!",
  "1.0.41.0" => "Your life is mine to do with as I please.",
  "1.0.42.0" => "But...why?!",
  "1.0.43.0" => "YOU. You shall be my servant...",
  "1.0.44.0" => "Help!",
  "1.0.45.0" => "Now be a good dog and do as your master
commands.",
  "1.0.46.0" => "Who could imagine that such an enemy would
pose a threat? Demon King, I beg your help!",
  "1.0.47.0" => "I am Ganondorf, the Demon King. Don't
take that title lightly...",
  "1.0.48.0" => "Apologies, but I must retreat to recover
my stamina...",
  "1.0.49.0" => "Fine, I can control this area without your
help!",
  "1.0.50.0" => "Hsss... Arrogant! Attack!",
  "1.0.51.0" => "Hmm... My abilities seem to be lacking at
the moment... I beg of you to help!",
  "1.0.52.0" => "Help? Aren't you a king in your own right?
And you need help from me?",
  "1.0.53.0" => "I am so very sorry... I must withdraw!",
  "1.0.54.0" => "Useless... Step aside. I'll take care of this
myself.",
  "1.0.55.0" => "Hsss... Lizalfos strong!",
  "1.0.56.0" => "Keh... Powerful!",
  "1.0.57.0" => "Kya! Strength growing!",
  "1.0.58.0" => "Feh! Tear to pieces!",
  "1.0.59.0" => "Hmm... Playing the fool, are we...?",
  "1.0.60.0" => "That building belongs to my master...
Let's capture it for him immediately.",
  "1.0.61.0" => "Keh! Gather allies!",
  "1.0.62.0" => "It would appear that these primitive creatures
are getting stronger... Hurry! Take their keeps!",
  "1.0.63.0" => "Geh! We strong! Not scared!",
  "1.0.64.0" => "No keep can withstand the might of a
true king!",
  "1.0.65.0" => "Noise from sssssouth... Investigate!",
  "1.0.66.0" => "The monsters in the northern desert are
aware of us. I'll stop them!",
  "1.0.67.0" => "They are but mindless animals. I will have
no trouble dispatching them.",
  "1.0.68.0" => "Keep in danger! Protectsssss it!",
  "1.0.69.0" => "Release prisonersssss! Make them
fightsssss for ussssss!",
  "1.0.70.0" => "Ah, they intend to use their prisoners against
us. Perhaps we could control them instead...",
  "1.0.71.0" => "Intriguing... Allow me to discuss the matter
with the northern captives.",
  "1.0.72.0" => "Marvelous. Then I shall speak with the
southern captives.",
  "1.0.73.0" => "Hear me, creatures! Serve our Lord Ganon
if you desire an honorable existence!",
  "1.0.74.0" => "Prisonerssss! We free you to fight for
ussss!",
  "1.0.75.0" => "Understood.",
  "1.0.76.0" => "Ah, it appears that this desert is just
crawling with beasts.",
  "1.0.77.0" => "That beast is no match for you, my lord!",
  "1.0.78.0" => "Ah, I didn't know such a beast still existed
in a place like this. How quaint.",
  "1.0.79.0" => "If we slay it, the rest of the vermin will
fall in line.",
  "1.0.80.0" => "Keh! Allies defeated! Revenge!",
  "1.0.81.0" => "We shall serve.",
  "1.0.82.0" => "My lord, we must gather around the beast.
We'll show it just how inferior it truly is!",
}